    <string name="wallet_create_tips_seed_1">The secret phrase (24 words) is the ONLY way to recover my wallet. If I lose it, my funds are gone forever.</string>
    <string name="wallet_create_tips_seed_2">I must keep it offline — paper, safe, or password manager — and NEVER share it with anyone.</string>
    <string name="wallet_create_tips_seed_3">Okaiwa has no way to recover my secret phrase for me. No support, no server backup: security is entirely on me.</string>

    <string name="wallet_create_tips_passkey_1">The private key is generated in my phone\'s StrongBox. It never leaves the device in the clear and is only accessible with my fingerprint or Face ID.</string>
    <string name="wallet_create_tips_passkey_2">The encrypted backup is synced through Google Password Manager (Android) or iCloud Keychain (iOS). I can therefore recover my wallet on a new phone by signing in.</string>
